# Revision 1 §16 with tests/dict_helper_fake.py. 1: Ctrl+J at the end of
# the first line: the longest end before the cursor (ことば), 明鏡.
END C-j SNAP
# 2: Tab, ←, →: the books after, before and after again (英和, not there). 3: Esc closes.
TAB LEFT RIGHT SNAP ESC SNAP
# 4: the English word around the cursor (apple), 英和.
DOWN HOME RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT C-j SNAP ESC
# 5: F3, かき typed with the input method, RET: three entries (1/3).
F3 M-SPC "kaki" RET M-SPC RET SNAP
# 6: Shift+→ (2/3). 7: Shift+← twice, past the first (3/3).
S-RIGHT SNAP S-LEFT S-LEFT SNAP
# 8: RET asks for another word (かき in the box). 9: Esc goes back to the box.
RET SNAP ESC SNAP ESC
# 10: the help lists the dictionary keys.
F1 SNAP ESC
